# GitHub Documentation

- For GitHub repositories, authentication, pull requests, issues, Actions, security, and GitHub CLI, use the official Portuguese documentation as the primary reference: https://docs.github.com/pt
- Consult the relevant official documentation page before recommending commands that affect remotes, credentials, branches, or repository settings.
- Prefer secure, current authentication and permission practices.
- Do not perform destructive or externally visible GitHub actions without explicit user authorization.
